{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:26 2026-09-05 HKT</p>\n\n<p>殿堂級練馬師蔡約翰擇定吉日，於今天(九月五日)分別在沙田馬房和從化同步舉行季前馬房拜神儀式。吉時一到，蔡約翰一如往年大刀揮金豬切燒豬，並帶領副練周瑞麟和馬房員工誠心上香，祈求新一個馬季一切順利，盡力為馬主交出好成績。</p>\n<p>今午到場的馬主眾多，場面熱鬧，例如有「魅力」和「知遇」系馬主鄧詠琪及其父親鄧偉彬馬主蕭百君、其子蕭劍平和蕭劍新，「嘉應」系梁錫光和其太太，開鑼日第六場「辣得準」馬主吳創木及其家人，「首飾」系馬主董滿輝，「跨境」系馬主吳海波，馬主陳國聰，女馬主衛淑莊等，蔡約翰的太太CoCo Size也有參與出席，場面非常熱鬧。</p>\n<p>另外，馬主梁錫光今午被問及「嘉應高昇」最新情況時說：「馬兒之前腳有少少腫，但好快已經恢復操練，健康已經無礙，希望開鑼日有好表現。」</p>\n<p>按圖睇有關相片：</p>\n<img alt=\"蔡約翰馬房\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/83d7445cffdb2d9649b376aaa69eefaa/2026-09/178859578671866.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡約翰誠心祈福\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/959365282b3c00348bfef9f70393c78e/2026-09/178859578625125.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡約翰誠心上香\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/d0948ba865dd261575dd7f1a415ff974/2026-09/178859578696497.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡約翰祈求今季事事順利\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/681d40a9cb1fb8515342ec0dd29d6cfb/2026-09/178859578672907.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡廄從化員工同步舉行季前馬房拜神儀式\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/43fbd7a098b9b932163608935ae2d9e8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-05_at_16_14_06_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡廄從化員工同步舉行季前馬房拜神儀式\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/445b0e2ed5fdf7f5bc628a11873a8b5e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-05_at_16_14_06_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡廄從化員工同步舉行季前馬房拜神儀式\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/235492d5bf26dce950318b734d11b30d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-05_at_16_14_06_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡廄從化員工同步舉行季前馬房拜神儀式\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/3428ff0f4258f9667dfbfd918727a1c8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-05_at_16_14_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡約翰（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/0e6027f481bc91ea15d031fb16af640b/2026-09/178859578640349.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"齊齊替金豬開邊\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/ec66d01728483a895577e573a7c98e6c/2026-09/178859578615829.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"眾來賓齊切金豬\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/cf43e2c020e5c77cb375e765ffd0a86a/2026-09/178859578620077.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"多位騎師出席蔡廄拜神儀式\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/39ea84ced712c0d25ea823e8855f362b/2026-09/178859578630321.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"田泰安（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/b15a6eb56f2d4f49bc3f0ff3e47e0f93/2026-09/178859578698359.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"布文（左二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/0e07867d537e0bcc5e3a7d19ad6fdeb0/2026-09/178859578642929.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"出席騎師陣容鼎盛\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/242107a7051a4a97fcfc00d9ed68c098/2026-09/178859578671249.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"巴度\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/48f41081ec35c9188562360010d6d1f3/2026-09/178859578622667.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蕭百君（左）與蕭劍新（右二）及蕭劍平（右）齊到場\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/c1448e9eb9ea706dd8d9a560efbaf4ff/2026-09/178859575576651.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「魅力」系馬主鄧偉彬（左）及鄧詠琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/0d03fa1cdd38ad00c622625f53ee3e30/2026-09/178859578634952.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「辣得準」馬主吳創木（左）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/909f3176d64de14fcad7a86b7f805991/2026-09/178859578643464.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「嘉應」系馬主梁錫光（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/69847ac54821f6b4620d06253ac458df/2026-09/178859578678782.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「眼光」系馬主譚榮根（右二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/c0b042dd8e00e21c401f3dced48f6639/2026-09/178859578637792.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「首飾」系馬主董滿輝（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/559a1da187481d74d192e24ac0e72e0c/2026-09/178859578641639.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「安」系馬主王忠秣（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/0aba27571b9adf02fcd0e90293ce68cb/2026-09/178859578780290.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T08:39:59.593741+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}